            "text": "{\n  \"judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0000\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F001\", \"F002\", \"F005\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposed edit incorporates substantive rules from subsection (1) and subsection (5) into the summary of claim C0002. However, C0002 specifically governs subsection (2) regarding additional fees for petit jurors. The other provisions are already independently represented by other claims (such as C0000, C0001, and C0005). Expanding C0002 to bundle separate statutory rules does not resolve an existing defect.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0001\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F002\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposed edit alters the modal force and legal effect of subsection (2) by asserting that the juror 'must be paid, without trial-judge discretion', directly contradicting the source text in F002, which provides that the fee 'may be paid, in the discretion of the trial judge'.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
